flowchart TD
    A[Directory Entry] -->|Contains| B[Filename: report.txt]
    B --> C["Inode #: 12345"]
    
    C --> D[Inode 12345]
    D --> E[Metadata]
    E --> E1[Type: regular file]
    E --> E2[Size: 8192 bytes]
    E --> E3[Permissions: 0644]
    E --> E4[Owner: user:group]
    E --> E5[Timestamps: atime, mtime, ctime]
    E --> E6[Links: 1]
    
    D --> F[Block Pointers]
    F --> F1[Direct 0: Block 5000]
    F --> F2[Direct 1: Block 5001]
    F --> F3[Direct 2: -]
    F --> F4[Indirect: -]
    
    F1 --> G1[Data: First 4KB]
    F2 --> G2[Data: Second 4KB]
    
    H[Hard Link] --> H1["report_backup.txt → 12345"]
    H1 -.->|Same inode!| D
    
    I[Symbolic Link] --> I1["shortcut.txt → /path/to/report.txt"]
    I1 -.->|Different inode| J[Inode 99999]
    J --> K["Content: string '/path/to/report.txt'"]
    
